A||N||6||Coop88||Rear glass replacement||||1||
Z||000000||Coop88||07-09-2000||06:25 AM||||Does anyone know how to remove the decklid hinges for removal of the rear glass? If not, how about an easier way? The wires for the defroster were also cut off. Can these be soldered back on or what? Thanks for any info.||||reg||1
Z||000001||PJ||07-09-2000||09:21 PM||||There ain't no easy way. You'll need a tamper-proof Torx bit to remove the torsion bar. Lisle makes an inexpensive set, try Pep Boys or your local equivalent. E-Mail me a fax # and I'll fax you the pages from the factory manual you'll need. I'll include the pages for fixing the defroster.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<BR>pjsolo@bellsouth.net||||reg||1
Z||000002||TOM||07-09-2000||11:26 PM||||I replaced my rear window with a defrost window.I did NOT remove the decklid and I did not break the glass to get it out. If you have any questions let me know.||||reg||1
Z||000003||RLMay||07-11-2000||04:20 AM||||Tom,<P>I'm in the process of installing a heated rear window in my 86 GT.  I have successfully removed the heated window from the donar car and am confidant I can remove the window in my GT without scratching the paint on the pinch weld.  I am interested in any advice you could give on installing the window, specifically what materials did you use.  Or did you have a glass shop actually install it?||||reg||1
Z||000004||TOM||07-11-2000||11:28 AM||||I went to a good parts store and got a caulk tube of the right sealant. You can also get it from a place that does glass install. then bascially just glue it in.||||reg||1
Z||000005||TOM||07-11-2000||11:29 AM||||No need to scrap all the sealant from the frame or the new glass. Just apply a thin bead of the goop and install.||||reg||1
Z||000006||dogtired||07-12-2000||06:42 AM||||PJ<BR>I tried to find your E-Mail address???<BR>Its not listed in your profile??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>Anyway I would like to see a copy of those pages from the factory manual also the defroster fixing pages.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Thanks if possible just send them to dogtired@juno.com    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
